Hello,
I found an integer overflow in search_in_range at regexec.c:5365:
```
5360	      sch_range = (UChar* )range;
5361	      if (reg->dmax != 0) {
5362	        if (reg->dmax == INFINITE_LEN)
5363	          sch_range = (UChar* )end;
